# Tinkerpad

Go/Wails desktop app + Solid/Vite frontend + PHP PHAR runner.

## Before reading files

- Do **not** scan `node_modules`, `php/vendor`, `frontend/dist`, `build/bin`, or `*.phar`.
- Prefer `frontend/src`, `backend`, `php/src`, `main.go`, `Makefile`.
- Wails JS bindings are generated (`frontend/wailsjs`); regenerate with `make generate` / `wails generate module`.

## After changing code

| Change | Then |
| --- | --- |
| `php/**` | `make phar`, then rebuild/restart the app |
| Go bindings / new exported methods | `wails generate module` (or `make generate`) |
| Frontend or full app | `make build` or `make dev` |

## Do not

- Hand-edit `resources/bin/php.phar` or commit edits only to `frontend/wailsjs`.
- Set local PHP `cmd.Dir` to the user project (breaks PHAR autoload).
- Expand scope into unrelated refactors; match existing Solid/Go style.
